OpenStreetMap-derived baked environment data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
License:  Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0
Upstream: https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
Attribution: "(c) OpenStreetMap contributors."
See overlume/assets/models/environment/ATTRIBUTION.md for full provenance
(Overpass API query, operating-area bounds, test fixture provenance). Data
only, not a code dependency; license per upstream, not independently
re-verified beyond the ATTRIBUTION.md file's own citation.

That ATTRIBUTION.md also documents a fallback: when Overpass is empty or
errors and `MAPBOX_TOKEN` is set (by name only — no token value recorded
here or anywhere in this project's docs), building footprints instead come
from Mapbox, subject to Mapbox's own terms of service rather than ODbL. A
baked environment asset produced through that fallback path is not covered
by the OpenStreetMap/ODbL attribution above.

